            "reviewBody": "4.20.21 Not sure what the fizzy lemon-lime soda is supposed to do, other than possibly making this less expensive. I didn’t think it added flavor to the margarita, and if anything, just diluted the pure margarita ingredients. Why use silver tequila, Rose’s lime juice, and triple sec, and then dilute it with soda? I know this has had very good reviews, so I suppose it’s just a matter of personal taste, but this was a disappointment for me.",
